      "source_grade": "REAL",
      "basis": "supervisor.c:126 打的是同一个 motor_get_gate_fail_mask()(motor.c:894-917)。bit3 protection-not-ready | bit4 drive-config-not-applied: 极性确认在 10、开 IRQ 在 11、apply 在 6, 所以这一步四门里两门未过。原件 = 2026-11-05 F11/F20 现场两次逐字节相同的 983 B/73abf3012386 捕获(行表 system_status 就是它)。",
      "status_lines_allow": [
        "^\\[Motor\\] arm gate fail mask=0x18 \\(arm REFUSED\\)$"
      ],
      "positive_requirement": [
        "[Motor] arm gate fail mask=0x18 (arm REFUSED)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "as": "mot_pre",
      "cmd": "motor_status",
      "rows_key": "motor_status_pre_apply",
      "expect_arm_gate_mask": [
        "0x18"
      ],
      "asserted_by": "must",
      "source_grade": "REAL",
      "basis": "motor.c:2479-2480 打 arm_gate_mask 与 REFUSED/ALL-PASS。原件 = 1128 B/f0550d313164, 在 5 次归档会话 + F20 本会话逐字节相同(F20 的第二个首错正是这一行被当成业务拒绝)。",
      "status_lines_allow": [
        "^\\[MOT\\] arm_gate_mask=0x18 REFUSED$"
      ],
      "positive_requirement": [
        "[MOT] arm_gate_mask=0x18 REFUSED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "as": "sys_after_apply",
      "cmd": "system_status",
      "rows_key": "system_status_applied",
      "expect_arm_gate_mask": [
        "0x8"
      ],
      "asserted_by": "must",
      "source_grade": "DERIVED",
      "basis": "apply 成功清 bit4(motor.c:907 的 tmc2209_drive_config_ok_for_arm), 而 IRQ/极性仍未就绪 => 只剩 bit3=0x8。0x8 这个值本身有真实原件(motor_status 的 1080 B/fa69aa5cf5a1, gate5 tmc_drive_cfg=CONFIGURED), 但**这一步(system_status)的 0x8 没在板上抓过**。",
      "status_lines_allow": [
        "^\\[Motor\\] arm gate fail mask=0x8 \\(arm REFUSED\\)$"
      ],
      "positive_requirement": [
        "[Motor] arm gate fail mask=0x8 (arm REFUSED)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "as": "mot_after_irq",
      "cmd": "motor_status",
      "rows_key": "motor_status_idle",
      "expect_arm_gate_mask": [
        "0x0"
      ],
      "asserted_by": "must",
      "source_grade": "REAL",
      "basis": "第 10 步极性 + 第 11 步开 IRQ => protection_ready(safety_thread.c:315 要 st_irq_attached && st_polarity_validated)成立, bit3 清零; bit4 已在第 6 步清。原件 = 648 B/10807f63f02a(9 次归档一致, 头行就是 arm_gate_mask=0x0 ALL-PASS)。",
      "status_lines_allow": [],
      "positive_requirement": [
        "[MOT] arm_gate_mask=0x0"
      ]
    },
